<title>FRANCE: Suez says creates real estate holding unit.</title>
<headline>Suez says creates real estate holding unit.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cie de Suez said on Monday it was creating a real estate holding company composed of 3.1 billion francs of real estate assets in Paris and the surrounding area.</p>
<p>Suez said the property in the holding company company was 90 percent rented and offered a gross rental yield of 7.5 percent.</p>
<p>The real estate holding company will be 100 percent owned by Suez, the company said.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +331 4221 5452</p>
